<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-14T19:23:12.772Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:23:12 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have launched missile and drone attacks on Saudi Arabia, targeting a weapons depot and troop gatherings near the Saudi border, while Saudi defenses intercepted drones headed for Riyadh. In Yemen, Houthi shelling hit Taiz villages, killing a child and wounding six civilians, and ballistic missiles were fired at Aden. France’s foreign ministry spokesperson said France favours adding pressure on the Houthis. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPcXIwbkFRM3dlZktvS0VBdHVLQURXY28xdmxYVnNnUUk3Sy1RRmd0dTNBeFhWS29TVVM1RVh3aGd5cmpObC1naWw4a25qTXRPOTRndFY0REw5UlY4d2tlR1dzMFNhbmlXc0NHSXMwWVpZcFZhOE1vQllfT3ZWZXU1X00wLWhiRnNPdmdnQnI4SUJrb0Q5eHRPRmlKYzg1akt0U0ZnM29LejY?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTFBYZGFvVTg1Z0NJd25KZlNHZkJPcE14OElkOW1GVTBqNTRkekdSdUNBOFBOaU5BODVMa3VETmduZXZpWHUza1JIRUNrRGNwV3Y5SjFOZHVLVl8yZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yemen Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE91ck1iSkZMMXNqMk5HeE9BM1A0NG9VZTA2aWpZR2ZQWE1PV2x3UXQtX2ZWNERVREhWMDdHRmZhR3JZNHFwVUtGaXh0RlFwMFpKdzZfNlJZaUszQkhVM0NWMjZsMlJ2WHdJZ0lJSWVpTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;houseofsaud.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTFBUeTJZMHBKMTBlVFdiNi12OUlLc1ZLa2hWOVZLME9iR3dsQlhfbTl2Wk1jUWFNRjN4clFUa09PSVctWV8xYU5kS2VXaVp3UDdycV9COVRXWkNoQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yemen Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFB6U3pGc3g0dWJYN0J0eVdpY2xseUUzT2dFemlJMHB